#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "%.2f%% a night"
msgstr "每晚%.2f%%"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Bank loan"
msgstr "银行贷款"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Credit line covered the overdraft"
msgstr "信用额度补上了透支"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Credit line draw"
msgstr "动用信用额度"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Credit line interest"
msgstr "信用额度利息"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Credit line repaid"
msgstr "还清信用额度"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Late fee"
msgstr "滞纳金"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Loan paid off"
msgstr "贷款已还清"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Loan payment"
msgstr "贷款还款"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "The bank lent you %s, paid back over %d days."
msgstr "银行借给你%s，分%d天还清。"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "The bank moved your credit rating from %s to %s."
msgstr "银行把你的信用评级从%s调整为%s。"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "You couldn't cover tonight's loan payment. The bank took it anyway, with a late fee."
msgstr "你付不起今晚的贷款还款。银行照样扣了钱，还加收了滞纳金。"

#: autoload/bank.gd
msgid "Your bank loan is paid off. Your credit rating is %s."
msgstr "你的银行贷款已经还清。你的信用评级是%s。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "%d more day"
msgid_plural "%d more days"
msgstr[0] "还有%d天"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "%s (in %d days)"
msgstr "%s（%d天后）"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "%s is over. %s starts tomorrow."
msgstr "%s结束了。明天开始%s。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "%s is over. You served %d of its customers."
msgstr "%s结束了。你接待了%d位顾客。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "%s, day %d of %d"
msgstr "%s，第%d天/共%d天"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "A silver coin for my nephew's stocking, please."
msgstr "请给我一枚银币，放进我外甥的圣诞袜里。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Autumn"
msgstr "秋季"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "COIN SHOW: collectors from three counties are in town for the weekend."
msgstr "钱币展：三个县的收藏家这个周末都来镇上了。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Coin show booth"
msgstr "钱币展展位"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Collectors pay well for exact coins and rare ones. A booth brings more of them."
msgstr "收藏家愿意为指定钱币和稀有钱币出高价。展位能吸引更多收藏家。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Debug: skipped ahead to day %d, %s."
msgstr "调试：跳到第%d天，%s。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Everyone's paying up for gold this week. My turn."
msgstr "这周大家都在高价买金子。轮到我了。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "GOLD FEVER: Prospector Days are on and the whole town wants gold."
msgstr "淘金热：淘金节开始了，全镇都想要黄金。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Gift buyers want small coins and pay a good premium. Keep the shelves full."
msgstr "买礼物的人想要小钱币，还肯多付溢价。把货架摆满。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Gift-wrapped, if you can. It's for my mum."
msgstr "能帮我包成礼物吗？是送给我妈的。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Gold buyers pay more all week. Stock up on gold coins."
msgstr "这一周买金的人出价更高。多囤些金币。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Gold fever week"
msgstr "淘金热周"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Gold fever, they call it. I've caught it."
msgstr "他们说这叫淘金热。我也染上了。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "HOLIDAY RUSH: shoppers want coins to give as gifts, and they pay for the wrapping."
msgstr "节日抢购：顾客想买钱币当礼物，还愿意付包装费。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Holiday gift rush"
msgstr "节日礼物抢购"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "In town for the show. What have you got?"
msgstr "我是来看钱币展的。你有什么货？"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Last-minute present. You're a lifesaver."
msgstr "最后一刻才买礼物。你真是救星。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "My accountant says sell. So I'm selling."
msgstr "我的会计说卖掉，所以我来卖。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Owe more than I thought this year. Cash, please."
msgstr "今年欠的税比我想的多。请给现金。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Panned this lot at the festival. Well, my grandpa did."
msgstr "这些是我在节上淘到的。好吧，是我爷爷淘的。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Prospector Days! I want real gold, not the fudge kind."
msgstr "淘金节！我要真金，不要金箔巧克力。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Saw the parade. Now I want a gold coin of my own."
msgstr "看了游行。现在我也想要一枚自己的金币。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Sellers want cash for their tax bills. Keep cash in the safe."
msgstr "卖家需要现金交税。保险柜里多备些现金。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Something gold for my wife. Not too big, I'm not made of money."
msgstr "给我老婆买点金的。别太大，我又不是印钞机。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Spring"
msgstr "春季"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Summer"
msgstr "夏季"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "TAX SEASON: the town is selling metal to pay the taxman. Tax Day is {last}."
msgstr "报税季：全镇都在卖金属交税。报税日是{last}。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Tax Day"
msgstr "报税日"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Tax Day: no profit since the last one, so no tax to pay."
msgstr "报税日：自上次以来没有利润，所以不用交税。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Tax Day: you paid %s, %d%% of your %s profit (after costs) since the last one."
msgstr "报税日：你交了%s，即自上次以来%d%%的%s利润（扣除成本后）。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Tax season"
msgstr "报税季"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "The taxman wants his cut. These have to go."
msgstr "税务员要分一杯羹。这些得卖掉。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Tomorrow: %s. %s"
msgstr "明天：%s。%s"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Town coin show"
msgstr "小镇钱币展"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "Winter"
msgstr "冬季"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "You booked a booth at the coin show. Collectors will find you."
msgstr "你订了钱币展的展位。收藏家会找上门来。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "collectors pay well."
msgstr "收藏家出价高。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "gold buyers pay more."
msgstr "买金的人出价更高。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "last day"
msgstr "最后一天"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "on %s"
msgstr "%s"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "small gifts sell well."
msgstr "小礼物好卖。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "tax of about {tax} due {tax_day}."
msgstr "{tax_day}需缴税约{tax}。"

#: autoload/calendar.gd scenes/shop/day_panels.gd
msgid "today"
msgstr "今天"

#: autoload/calendar.gd
msgid "tomorrow"
msgstr "明天"

#: autoload/calendar.gd scenes/shop/day_panels.gd
msgid "tonight"
msgstr "今晚"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s coins for the collection. I pay for quality."
msgstr "收藏用的%s钱币。品相好我就付好价钱。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s has found another shop."
msgstr "%s找了另一家店。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s is back."
msgstr "%s回来了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s sold you fakes and walked off laughing."
msgstr "%s卖给你假币，笑着走了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s walked in."
msgstr "%s走了进来。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s will come back when you have %s in stock."
msgstr "等你有%s的货，%s会再来。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s won't be coming back."
msgstr "%s不会再来了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "%s%.1f stars"
msgstr "%s%.1f星"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Ada Okafor"
msgstr "Ada Okafor"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Ada Okafor is your newest customer. Her grandma is very proud."
msgstr "Ada Okafor是你最新的顾客。她奶奶为她骄傲极了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Ada got into the science programme! Ten more for the fund."
msgstr "Ada考上了理科班！再给基金添十枚。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Albions next. Three, for a display on the history of coinage."
msgstr "下一个是阿尔比恩。要三枚，用来办钱币史展览。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Any %s coins? Nice strike, no spots, please."
msgstr "有%s钱币吗？压印要好，不要斑点。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Back from the dead! Diamond hands. Give me your shiniest."
msgstr "起死回生！钻石手。把你最亮的给我。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Brayden"
msgstr "Brayden"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Buying the crypto dip. Need cash for it, bro."
msgstr "抄底加密币。需要现金，兄弟。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Cash only. No paperwork. You understand."
msgstr "只要现金。不要文件。你懂的。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Chad"
msgstr "Chad"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Chad bought gold to 'diversify his bag'."
msgstr "Chad买了金子，说是\"分散他的仓位\"。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Chad posted your shop to all his followers. 'Based gold guy.'"
msgstr "Chad把你的店发给了他所有粉丝。\"黄金大佬，靠谱。\""

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Chad sold his gold back after a bad week in crypto."
msgstr "Chad在加密币里亏了一周，又把金子卖了回来。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Detective Ruiz"
msgstr "Detective Ruiz"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Detective Ruiz paid you the reward for Vinnie's fakes."
msgstr "Detective Ruiz把Vinnie假币案的赏金付给了你。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Detective Ruiz warned you about buying from Vinnie."
msgstr "Detective Ruiz提醒你别从Vinnie那儿收货。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Diversifying my bag. Need gold, like, now."
msgstr "分散仓位。我要金子，就现在。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Don't ask about my portfolio. Just buy these."
msgstr "别问我的投资组合。买下这些就行。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Dr. Vance is building a museum display on the history of coinage."
msgstr "Dr. Vance正在筹办一个钱币史博物馆展览。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Dr. Vance's display opens at the town museum next week."
msgstr "Dr. Vance的展览下周在镇博物馆开幕。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Dr. Vance, a collector, added your Veldrand to her cabinet."
msgstr "收藏家Dr. Vance把你的维尔德金币收进了她的柜子。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Everything's negotiable, friend."
msgstr "一切都好商量，朋友。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Fresh from my uncle's estate. Very fresh. Cash, yeah?"
msgstr "刚从我叔叔的遗产里拿来的。非常新鲜。现金，好吗？"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Gold's the OG blockchain, bro."
msgstr "黄金才是元祖区块链，兄弟。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Got liquidated. Need those hawks turned back into fiat. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "被强平了。得把这些隼币换回法币。别告诉别人。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Got margin-called. Need fiat, fast."
msgstr "被追保证金了。急需法币。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Grandma's silver paid for my first year. Now I'm starting my own stack."
msgstr "奶奶的银币付了我第一年的学费。现在我要开始攒自己的。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Grandpa Lev"
msgstr "Grandpa Lev"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Grandpa Lev sold you the first of his late wife's coins. He'll be back."
msgstr "Grandpa Lev卖给你他亡妻的第一批钱币。他还会再来。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Grandpa Lev sold you the last of Mira's coins. He looked lighter, somehow."
msgstr "Grandpa Lev卖给你Mira的最后一批钱币。他看起来轻松了些。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Grandpa Lev told the whole bowling league about your shop."
msgstr "Grandpa Lev跟整个保龄球队都说了你的店。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Grandpa Lev told you how Mira saved a coin from every trip they took."
msgstr "Grandpa Lev告诉你，Mira每次旅行都会留一枚钱币。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Her favourite. I kept this one till last."
msgstr "她最喜欢的。我把这枚留到了最后。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "I collect %s coins. Nothing else will do."
msgstr "我收藏%s钱币。别的都不要。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "I collect Veldrands. Do you have one with a crisp springbok?"
msgstr "我收藏维尔德金币。有跳羚图案清晰的吗？"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "I never pay sticker. Let's talk."
msgstr "我从不按标价买。我们谈谈。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Jaxon"
msgstr "Jaxon"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Just took profits. Turn it into something shiny."
msgstr "刚止盈。换成亮闪闪的东西。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Last time, I promise. These ones are definitely real."
msgstr "最后一次，我保证。这些绝对是真的。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Last top-up before she goes. Ten more, and wish her luck."
msgstr "她走之前最后一次存。再来十枚，祝她好运。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Let's not insult each other. What's your real number?"
msgstr "别互相侮辱了。你的真实价位是多少？"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Moonboy Mike"
msgstr "Moonboy Mike"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "More of Mira's collection. She'd want it to go to someone honest."
msgstr "更多Mira的收藏。她会希望交给一个诚实的人。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Mrs. Okafor finished Ada's college fund."
msgstr "Okafor太太存满了Ada的大学基金。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Mrs. Okafor started a college fund in silver for her granddaughter."
msgstr "Okafor太太用银币为孙女开了一个大学基金。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Mrs. Okafor's granddaughter got into the science programme."
msgstr "Okafor太太的孙女考上了理科班。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "My Mira bought one of these every birthday. Time to let a few go."
msgstr "我家Mira每个生日都买一枚。是时候放手几枚了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "My cousin's coins. He's... away."
msgstr "我表哥的钱币。他……出远门了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "My grandson graduates Friday. I want to buy him a gold coin, and I want it from you."
msgstr "我孙子周五毕业。我想送他一枚金币，而且要在你这儿买。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "My old teacher's hawks. I want them in good hands, not a fair price."
msgstr "我老师的隼币。我想让它们找个好主人，价格不重要。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "New batch. Same uncle. Different estate."
msgstr "新的一批。同一个叔叔。不同的遗产。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Priced to move. Don't ask where they're from."
msgstr "便宜出。别问是哪来的。"

#: autoload/customers.gd autoload/orders.gd scenes/grading/coin_grade.gd
msgid "Professor Hale"
msgstr "Professor Hale"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Quick deal, yeah? I'm double parked."
msgstr "快点成交，好吗？我车违停了。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Reward"
msgstr "奖励"

#: autoload/customers.gd autoload/story.gd
msgid "Reward: "
msgstr "奖励："

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Silver for my granddaughter Ada's college fund. Five, please."
msgstr "给我孙女Ada的大学基金买银币。请来五枚。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Some Guy"
msgstr "Some Guy"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Tanner"
msgstr "Tanner"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "The centrepiece: a Platinum Liberty Hawk. The museum opens next week."
msgstr "压轴之作：一枚自由隼铂金币。博物馆下周开幕。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "The museum display credits your shop. People are talking."
msgstr "博物馆展览上写了你店的名字。大家都在议论。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Took some profits, bro. Gold's the original blockchain."
msgstr "止盈了，兄弟。黄金是最早的区块链。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Two-Phones Tony"
msgstr "Two-Phones Tony"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Vinnie"
msgstr "Vinnie"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "Vinnie's been passing fakes all over town. Some ended up in your vault. Test your coins."
msgstr "Vinnie在全镇散布假币。有些进了你的金库。检测一下你的钱币。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "We picked up Vinnie's counterfeit ring. Your tips helped. The town's reward is yours."
msgstr "我们端掉了Vinnie的假币团伙。你的线索帮了大忙。镇上的赏金归你。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "You caught %s's %s fakes. He'll try again."
msgstr "你识破了%s的%s假币。他还会再试。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "You caught %s's fakes again. Word is the police are interested."
msgstr "你又识破了%s的假币。听说警察很感兴趣。"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "collector"
msgstr "收藏家"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "crypto bro"
msgstr "币圈小哥"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "haggler"
msgstr "砍价高手"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "looks nervous"
msgstr "神色紧张"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "old coin"
msgstr "老钱币"

#: autoload/customers.gd
msgid "regular"
msgstr "常客"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Friday"
msgstr "星期五"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Insurance"
msgstr "保险"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Monday"
msgstr "星期一"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Overdraft interest"
msgstr "透支利息"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Rent"
msgstr "房租"

#: autoload/day.gd scenes/auction/auction_house.gd scenes/shop/rush_hours.gd
msgid "Saturday"
msgstr "星期六"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "星期日"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "星期四"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "星期二"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "Upkeep"
msgstr "维护费"

#: autoload/day.gd scenes/auction/auction_house.gd
msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "星期三"

#: autoload/day.gd
msgid "You are overdrawn. The bank charges interest every night."
msgstr "你已透支。银行每晚都会收取利息。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "\"We buy gold\" in your best chalk lettering."
msgstr "用你最漂亮的粉笔字写着\"收购黄金\"。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A big glossy palm, the kind hotel lobbies have."
msgstr "一棵油亮的大棕榈，酒店大堂里那种。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A buzzing neon gold bar on a stand. Customers love a photo with it."
msgstr "支架上一块嗡嗡作响的霓虹金条。顾客都爱和它合影。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A founding father of coinage, in white marble on a plinth."
msgstr "一位钱币先贤的白色大理石半身像，立在底座上。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A gilded lion spouting water into a marble basin. Coins in it go to charity."
msgstr "一头镀金狮子往大理石池里喷水。池里的硬币都捐给慈善。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A glass-topped pedestal showing off a few proof coins."
msgstr "一个玻璃顶展台，陈列着几枚精制币。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A leafy fern in a terracotta pot."
msgstr "陶盆里一株茂盛的蕨类。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A life-size gilded eagle, wings spread, on a marble column."
msgstr "一只真鸟大小的镀金雄鹰，展翅立在大理石柱上。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A standing lamp dripping with crystal drops."
msgstr "一盏挂满水晶坠子的落地灯。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A tall glass cabinet of rings and chains, lit from inside."
msgstr "一个高高的玻璃柜，摆着戒指和项链，内部有灯光。"

#: autoload/decor.gd
msgid "A tall indoor fig. Makes the corner feel like a shop, not a booth."
msgstr "一棵高大的室内无花果树。让这个角落像家店，而不是小摊。"

