msgstr "一位顾客"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "你确定吗？"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Bar test"
msgstr "金条检测"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Bills come out each night, and the day's numbers land here. Tomorrow morning, spend your profit on upgrades and keep an eye on the ticker. Good luck!"
msgstr "账单每晚结算，当天的数字会显示在这里。明天早上，把利润花在升级上，并留意行情条。祝你好运！"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Bought!"
msgstr "买到了！"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Burglars take whatever's left on the tray. Drag your stock into the safes: the floor safe never gets cracked, the wall safe sometimes does. Right-click turns a piece. The longer the lights stay on, the riskier it gets, so be quick."
msgstr "窃贼会拿走托盘上剩下的一切。把库存拖进保险柜：地下保险柜从不会被撬开，墙内保险柜有时会。右键旋转物品。灯开得越久越危险，所以动作要快。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Catching fakes earns reputation. Fakes you buy cost you the money and your stars when the assay lab checks them."
msgstr "识破假货能赢得声誉。买到的假货被化验室查出时，你会损失付出的钱和星级。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Caught in the act"
msgstr "当场抓住"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Caught!"
msgstr "抓到了！"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Coin grading"
msgstr "钱币评级"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Day one done"
msgstr "第一天结束"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Each tool checks one thing. Press 1 for the Scale and 2 for the Calipers, then compare each READING with the SPEC next to it."
msgstr "每个工具检查一项。按1使用秤，按2使用卡尺，然后把每个读数和旁边的规格对比。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Five silver coins, please. A birthday present."
msgstr "请给我五枚银币。生日礼物。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Got it"
msgstr "明白了"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Here comes someone else. Keep an eye on this one."
msgstr "又来了一位。留意这个人。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Jewellery appraisal"
msgstr "珠宝鉴定"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "June left without selling. That's fine; there's always another customer."
msgstr "June没卖就走了。没关系，总会有下一位顾客。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "June wants to sell %d Silver Hawks. Melt today is what the silver in them is worth. Your offer is what you'd pay. Never buy coins untested: press Test coin."
msgstr "June想卖%d枚自由隼银币。今日熔化价是其中白银的价值。你的出价是你愿意付的钱。绝不要买没检测的钱币：按\"检测钱币\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "June's coins are in your vault now. You can see them under IN THE VAULT."
msgstr "June的钱币现在在你的金库里了。你可以在\"金库库存\"下看到它们。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Live prices"
msgstr "实时价格"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Lock up"
msgstr "锁门"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Make an offer"
msgstr "出价"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Move the lamp round the coin with the mouse: close in it shines from above, far out it rakes low. Worn high points stay flat and dull and break the lustre's spinning cartwheel. Press 2 for the loupe and click bag marks to count them; 3 opens the guide. Tick Cleaned if fine hairlines show under a low light."
msgstr "用鼠标让灯绕着钱币移动：靠近时光从上方照下，远离时光从低处斜照。磨损的高点平而暗淡，会打断光泽旋转的车轮光。按2用放大镜，点击袋痕来计数；按3打开指南。如果低角度光下能看到细纹，就勾选\"清洗过\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "My dad's old Silver Hawks. I'd like a fair price."
msgstr "我爸的旧自由隼银币。希望价格公道。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "No deal"
msgstr "不成交"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Now you're on your own. Customers keep coming until 17:00, then you lock up the vault. Jewellery and bars have their own benches; you'll get a quick intro to each the first time."
msgstr "现在你要靠自己了。顾客会一直来到17:00，然后你要把金库锁好。首饰和金条有各自的工作台；第一次使用时会有简短介绍。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "One more. This one wants to buy."
msgstr "再来一位。这位想买东西。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Open up"
msgstr "开门"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Played it safe"
msgstr "谨慎行事"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Press Open the shop when you're ready."
msgstr "准备好了就按\"开门营业\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Priya wants 5 silver coins from your vault. She pays melt plus your premium. Press Sell."
msgstr "Priya想从你的金库买5枚银币。她付熔化价加上你的溢价。按\"卖出\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Read the bench"
msgstr "看工作台"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Real coins. Press Make offer to buy them at your price."
msgstr "真币。按\"出价\"以你的价格买下它们。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Real silver only drags a little. This coin snapped to the magnet: it's plated steel. Press Fake."
msgstr "真银只会被轻微拖动。这枚钱币被磁铁猛地吸住：它是镀层钢币。按\"假货\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Selling"
msgstr "卖出"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Show me"
msgstr "给我看看"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Silver Hawks, cheap. Cash only, no questions, yeah?"
msgstr "便宜的自由隼银币。只要现金，不问问题，好吧？"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Skip tutorial"
msgstr "跳过教程"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Slick's in a hurry and won't haggle. Cheap coins from a nervous seller are often fake. Test them too."
msgstr "Slick很急，不会砍价。神色紧张的卖家手里的便宜钱币常常是假的。也要检测。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Sold!"
msgstr "卖掉了！"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Start the clock"
msgstr "开始计时"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Steel fakes give themselves away to a magnet. Press 4."
msgstr "钢制假币一碰磁铁就露馅。按4。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "That's the counter"
msgstr "这就是柜台"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "The coin test"
msgstr "钱币检测"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "The magnet"
msgstr "磁铁"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "The ticker shows today's spot prices from the real market. Every coin's value follows them, so the same coin is worth more on some days than others."
msgstr "行情条显示的是真实市场的今日现货价。每枚钱币的价值都随之变动，所以同一枚钱币有些日子更值钱。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Those coins snapped to the magnet. You can still press Refuse."
msgstr "那些钱币被磁铁吸住了。你仍然可以按\"拒绝\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Those were plated steel. The assay lab will catch them soon and you'll lose what you paid. Always test first."
msgstr "那些是镀层钢币。化验室很快会查出来，你会损失付出的钱。一定要先检测。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Too good to be true?"
msgstr "好得不像真的？"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Tungsten weighs almost the same as gold, so the scale isn't enough. Press 3 and sweep the ultrasound probe over the whole bar: the echo must stay inside the gate, and an early echo means tungsten inside. Read the serial under the loupe; a copied serial gets flagged. The XRF gun comes as an upgrade."
msgstr "钨的重量几乎和金一样，所以光靠秤不够。按3，用超声波探头扫遍整根金条：回波必须保持在闸门内，回波提前出现说明里面有钨。在放大镜下读序列号；复制的序列号会被标记。XRF枪可以通过升级获得。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Turning away untested coins is safe. Testing them proves it, and catching a fake earns reputation."
msgstr "拒收没检测的钱币是安全的。检测能证明真假，识破假货还能赢得声誉。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Tutorial skipped. Good luck!"
msgstr "已跳过教程。祝你好运！"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Uh oh"
msgstr "糟糕"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Weigh the piece. Then press 2 to rub a streak on the touchstone and drop acids on it (Q-Y): the streak survives acids up to its karat, and base metal fizzes. The Tester checks a stone; moissanite fools it, so look for doubled facet edges under the loupe. Set the grade (G) and the stone (D), then Finish appraisal."
msgstr "称一下首饰。然后按2在试金石上划出痕迹，再滴上酸液（Q-Y）：划痕在不高于其K数的酸液中不会消失，贱金属会冒泡。测试仪检测宝石；莫桑石能骗过它，所以要在放大镜下找重影的刻面边缘。设置成色（G）和宝石（D），然后点\"完成鉴定\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Weight, diameter and thickness all match the spec. This is a real Silver Hawk. Press Genuine."
msgstr "重量、直径和厚度都与规格一致。这是一枚真自由隼银币。按\"真货\"。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Welcome to your shop"
msgstr "欢迎来到你的店"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "You buy and sell gold, silver and platinum at real market prices. Your goal: the biggest store in town. Let's serve your first customers together."
msgstr "你按真实市场价格买卖黄金、白银和铂金。你的目标：镇上最大的商店。我们一起来接待你的第一批顾客吧。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "You pay sellers a little under melt and charge buyers a little over it. That gap is your profit. The -/+ buttons change both, but push too far and customers walk."
msgstr "你付给卖家的价格略低于熔化价，向买家收的略高于熔化价。这个差价就是你的利润。-/+按钮会同时调整两者，但调得太过，顾客就会走。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Your first customer"
msgstr "你的第一位顾客"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Your first customer is walking up to the counter."
msgstr "你的第一位顾客正走向柜台。"

#: scenes/tutorial/coach.gd
msgid "Your margins"
msgstr "你的利润率"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Alarm: -%d%% risk"
msgstr "警报：风险-%d%%"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Break-in overnight! Lost %s."
msgstr "昨晚有人入室盗窃！损失%s。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Break-in risk"
msgstr "入室盗窃风险"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Break-in risk was %d%%, with %d%% of the value locked away."
msgstr "入室盗窃风险为%d%%，有%d%%的价值被锁起来了。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Break-in: %s!"
msgstr "入室盗窃：%s！"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Burglars can't crack it"
msgstr "窃贼撬不开"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Closing time"
msgstr "打烊时间"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Cracked the wall safe: %s."
msgstr "撬开了墙内保险柜：%s。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Crews crack it %d%% of the time"
msgstr "盗窃团伙有%d%%的几率撬开"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Crews crack it %d%%, pros %d%%"
msgstr "团伙撬开几率%d%%，职业大盗%d%%"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Drag stock into the safes. Right-click or R turns a piece. What's left on the tray is easy pickings, and the longer the lights stay on, the likelier a break-in."
msgstr "把库存拖进保险柜。右键或按R旋转物品。留在托盘上的东西很容易被偷，灯开得越久，越可能遭到入室盗窃。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Enter locks up. At zero it locks itself."
msgstr "按Enter锁门。倒数到零时会自动锁上。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "FLOOR SAFE"
msgstr "地下保险柜"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Grabbed the best of the counter tray: %s. They left the rest."
msgstr "抢走了柜台托盘上最好的东西：%s。其余的没拿。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Insurance pays back %s."
msgstr "保险赔付%s。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Left on the tray"
msgstr "留在托盘上"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Lights out in"
msgstr "熄灯倒计时"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Lock up now"
msgstr "立即锁门"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Locked away"
msgstr "已锁好"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Nobody came, and everything was locked away."
msgstr "没人来，而且所有东西都锁好了。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Nobody came. Lucky: %s sat out on the counter all night."
msgstr "没人来。运气好：%s在柜台上放了一整夜。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Quiet night"
msgstr "平静的夜晚"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Quiet night. The vault was untouched."
msgstr "平静的夜晚。金库完好无损。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "See the day's results"
msgstr "查看当天结果"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "The cameras caught them. Police got back %s."
msgstr "摄像头拍到了他们。警方追回了%s。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "The customer ledger is gone. Reputation -%.1f."
msgstr "顾客名册丢了。声誉-%.1f。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "The floor safe held."
msgstr "地下保险柜守住了。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "They couldn't crack the wall safe."
msgstr "他们撬不开墙内保险柜。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "They never touched the safes."
msgstr "他们根本没碰保险柜。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Took everything on the counter tray: %s."
msgstr "拿走了柜台托盘上的一切：%s。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Total lost: %s."
msgstr "总损失：%s。"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "VAULT LOCK-UP"
msgstr "金库锁门"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "WALL SAFE"
msgstr "墙内保险柜"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "Worth %s today"
msgstr "今日价值%s"

#: scenes/vault/vault.gd
msgid "and more"
msgstr "还有更多"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "%s in notes"
msgstr "%s现钞"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Cash straps"
msgstr "现金捆"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Counter tray"
msgstr "柜台托盘"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Customer ledger"
msgstr "顾客名册"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Floor safe"
msgstr "地下保险柜"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Gold coin box"
msgstr "金币盒"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Insurance payout"
msgstr "保险赔付"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Lose it: -%.1f reputation"
msgstr "丢失：声誉-%.1f"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Monster box"
msgstr "大银币箱"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Names and addresses."
msgstr "姓名和地址。"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Platinum box"
msgstr "铂金盒"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Silver tube"
msgstr "银币管"

#: scenes/vault/vault_layout.gd
msgid "Wall safe"
msgstr "墙内保险柜"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "%s · saved %s"
msgstr "%s · 保存于%s"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Each slot saves every morning and every night."
msgstr "每个存档位每天早晚各保存一次。"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Play"
msgstr "开始"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Slot %d deleted."
msgstr "已删除存档位%d。"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Slot %d · Day %d · %s"
msgstr "存档位%d · 第%d天 · %s"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Slot %d · empty"
msgstr "存档位%d · 空"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Start a new shop here"
msgstr "在这里开一家新店"

#: ui/save_slots_panel.gd
msgid "Sure?"
msgstr "确定？"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Auto (%s)"
msgstr "自动（%s）"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "货币"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Effects"
msgstr "音效"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Off"
msgstr "关"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "On"
msgstr "开"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "缩放"

#: ui/settings_panel.gd
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "音量"
